						</li>
						<li>
							Historical context: the subsequent discovery of the pion and the development of meson theory in the 1940s–1950s.
						</li>
						<li>
							Overview: standard histories of nuclear and particle physics, including Nobel Prize documentation (1949).
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div>
					<div class="mb-2 text-sm uppercase tracking-[4px] text-white/40">Related</div>
